{# The rows always in sight of the ⌨ panel (the frame's `keys` block, `page_frame.html.j2`) of a
   page of photos to pick (`browse`, `search`, the phone page): the same gestures and keys on
   every such page (`pick_grid.js.j2`); its *More keys* are `pick_keys_more.html.j2`. The page
   sets `pick_all` (what Ctrl+A picks); a page where a pick means something else (the phone
   page) sets `pick_marks = false` (no Delete, ⌫). Its 🔒 line is the page's `keys_safe`. #}
    <dt><kbd>Shift</kbd>+{{ _("click") }}</dt><dd>{{ _("every file from the last one clicked") }}</dd>
    <dt>☑ · <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+{{ _("click") }}</dt><dd>{{ _("add or take out one file") }}</dd>
    <dt>{{ _("drag") }}</dt><dd>{{ _("a rectangle: the files it touches (Ctrl adds them)") }}</dd>
    <dt><kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>A</kbd></dt><dd>{{ pick_all }}</dd>
    <dt><kbd>I</kbd></dt><dd>{{ _("invert: the others instead") }}</dd>
{% if pick_marks | default(true) %}
    <dt><kbd>Delete</kbd></dt><dd>{{ _("set the picked files aside") }}</dd>
{% endif %}
